  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>No of radial node&nbsp; =&nbsp; n &nbsp;- ℓ - 1&nbsp;&nbsp;.<br /><br />I(3p) ---- n = 3 and ℓ =1.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;One radial node&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />II(3d) ----&nbsp; n = 3 and ℓ =2.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;No radial node&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br /><br />III(3s) ---- &nbsp;n = 3 and ℓ&nbsp;=0.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Two radial nodes.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />All the orbitals provided in choices belong to match.&nbsp;I(3p), II(3d), III(3s)</p>",
